{tempo: 128}

INTRODUCTION
[C] [C/B] [Am] [Am/G] [F] [D] [G] [G7]

VERSE 1
You [C]heal the broken-[Am]hearted
And You [F]bind up every [G]wound.
You [F]number [G]all the [C]starry [Am]hosts
And You [Dm]give each song its [G]tune.
You [C]comfort the af[Am]flicted,
For these [F]things we bless Your [G]name.
Our [F]praise is [G]often [C]feeble, [Am]Lord,
But You [F]love us just the [G]same.

